      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'He however is more closely connected to the lack of empathy.  When
          a disaster happens - it is our job as people to help one another as teaches
          the Holy Owl.  Though some would rather ignore or cheer at the death of
          innocents if it means that it is one less problem to their safety.  It
          is the inherit selfishness of apathy that this devil truly feeds on and
          must be viligante on your own passion justice.

'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
