        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: All devils know of their history and Greed is no expectation.  The
          devils of sin have a special contract in which, the devils can't break
          whats on the contract nor can they add unless specifically stated.  This
          means that devils have to give the other what they want but that person
          must get the devil what he wants.
