      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: What the devil of Greed usually wants is his power restored, slaves
          returned, or an economic oppurtunity in which he can enrich himself.  Unfornatley
          the rich talk with this devil alot but their souls and stories carry what
          happen when you deal with him.
