        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: A devil of ambition but also of loyality to his masters.  The strongest
          out of all and mainly used as a general.  He doesn't maniplatate like the
          others because he is content being a pawn for his masters.  As Pride doesn't
          need to think when stubbornly clinging to other's wills.
