        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: To explain his philosophy - back in the day when humans owned slaves. 
          The authorities or masters would take their slaves either man/women to
          "use" them.  They did not do this out of sexual drive as some did this
          with the same sex.  But in a yearning for control, for power over another
          in the most complete way possible.  That is the Devil of Lust.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
