        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Devils of Sin don''t really die.  They usually respawn in a chamber
          in the Depths.  So the Wrath you meet can either be one bent on the destruction
          of all things including hell for the sake of hating the concept of life
          or push the idea of destruction on others.  Regardless he is the devil
          that changes the most in philosophy and goals.

