    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I decided to write down a report of the strange disease swimming in
          the air of our home.  And to write my frustration with the nobles.  After
          all, what are they going to do? Kill me?  Better then to be eaten.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 3
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 72.66667
        y: 91.33334
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It all started when one of the workers in the sweat shop dropped dead. 
          A common occurance but one with concerning signs.  The corpse with filled
          with yellow puss, their ears leaking and thier face slowly disintergrating. 
          The first victim laughed quietly but almost like he knew or at least was
          happy with death.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 85.33334
        y: 156
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The council of nobles knew, but when we found it only effected the
          workers they ignored my pleas to at least fix the labor's privy.  That
          would require them to spend money on their workers though... I never thought
          that would bite us again.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 7
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 80.000015
        y: 211.33331
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Some time passed and the bodies that were infected - I ordered that
          they be burn to stop any possible contamination.  I already knew they were
          dead... But they got up... and that's when it happened.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: 
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 7
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 78.6667
        y: 290.66666
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 8
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Every worker turned into one of those things - an abomination.  Even
          the ones that were still alive were just pretending to be alive until they
          rushed and smash all the guards head in.  They cheered and spoke but they
          weren't alive anymore that much I could tell.  The guards they killed turned
          into those bloated corpses with the parasites moving their bodies.  Me,
          some nobles, and a handful of guards locked up in here. Praying for help...
          I hope we get it soon.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
