      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: By the Owl... I'm done for.  The monsters they bang on the door as
          I bleed out.  God I ask forgiveness for whatever your humble servent did. 
          I worked for these nobles for years and I hope to find rest soon... (The
          writing is shown to be unfinished and blood makes the rest hard to read)
        type: 0
